<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM5.1.10">
<l>kāmar tātaika rutalar ciṅkaṅ</l>
<l rend="indent">kāṇa viṉiya karuṅkuḻal kuṭṭaṉ</l>
<l>vāmaṉa ṉeṉmara katavaṇ ṇaṉ</l>
<l rend="indent">māta vaṉmatu cūtaṉaṉ taṉṉai</l>
<l>cēma naṉkama rumputu vaiyarkōṉ</l>
<l rend="indent">viṭṭu cittaṉvi yantamiḻ pattum</l>
<l>nāma meṉṟuna viṉṟuraip pārkaḷ</l>
<l rend="indent">naṇṇu vārollai nāraṇa ṉulakē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Those who speak incessantly the names –</l>
<l rend="indent">Father of Kāma, lion to [his] foes,</l>
<l rend="indent">black haired boy [who] is sweet to see,</l>
<l rend="indent">Vāmana, my emerald hued [Lord], Mādhava, Madhusūdana –</l>
<l>in these ten Tamil [verses] given by Viṭṭucittaṉ,</l>
<l rend="indent">king of Putuvai where [all] abide in safety and prosperity,</l>
<l>[they] will promptly reach the world of Nāraṇaṉ.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
